about those Chinese savages?

816
00:58:23.108 --> 00:58:25.409
Get rid of them. Send them home!

817
00:58:28.242 --> 00:58:30.140
Becky, honey, who...
who did this to you?

818
00:58:30.142 --> 00:58:32.574
Yonah Wan.

819
00:58:32.576 --> 00:58:33.874
She's the daughter
of the Chairman

820
00:58:33.876 --> 00:58:37.475
