- Yes, sir.

837
00:59:27.776 --> 00:59:28.807
Granted.

838
00:59:28.809 --> 00:59:30.307
Just don't make this
a waste of my time.

839
00:59:30.309 --> 00:59:32.473
- Definitely not, sir.
- All right.

840
00:59:32.475 --> 00:59:34.108
Come in.

841
00:59:37.509 --> 00:59:38.640
Sir.

842
00:59:38.642 --> 00:59:41.140
