- I can't let you in.

1017
01:12:32.009 --> 01:12:33.874
- Grandmaster.
- Billy.

1018
01:12:33.876 --> 01:12:35.707
- Can you help us?
- I wish I could.

1019
01:12:35.709 --> 01:12:39.307
Her father, Mr. Wan Zhong Hua,
